  social_communities: 'Social communities are groups or spaces inside existing social platforms where people gather around a topic, identity, or shared interest. Brands can participate there to listen, support, and build belonging.',
  advocacy: 'Brand advocate programs identify and support customers who are willing to recommend the brand publicly. These people can become a powerful source of trust, reviews, referrals, and user insight.',
